flowchart LR
    ORGANIZATION[(Organization DB<br/>DEPARTMENT · STAFF · ACCOUNT)]
    PATIENT[(Patient DB<br/>PATIENT)]
    CLINICAL[(Clinical DB<br/>APPOINTMENT · MEDICAL_RECORD · DIAGNOSIS)]
    LAB[(Lab DB<br/>LAB_TEST · LAB_RESULT · PROCESSED_EVENT)]
    PHARMACY[(Pharmacy DB<br/>DRUG · PRESCRIPTION · LINE<br/>DISPENSE_SLIP · RESERVATION · PROCESSED_EVENT)]
    BILLING[(Billing DB<br/>FEE · INVOICE · PROCESSED_EVENT)]
    NOTIFICATION[(Notification DB<br/>NOTIFICATION · PROCESSED_EVENT)]
    REPORT[(Report DB<br/>DAILY_VISIT · MONTHLY_REVENUE<br/>DRUG_STATISTIC · PROCESSED_EVENT)]
    EVENTS[(RabbitMQ<br/>mediflow.events)]

    ORGANIZATION -.->|doctor_id, department_id · UUID/REST| CLINICAL
    PATIENT -.->|patient_id · UUID/REST| CLINICAL
    CLINICAL -.->|record_id · UUID logic| LAB
    PATIENT -.->|patient_id · UUID logic| LAB
    ORGANIZATION -.->|department_id · UUID logic| LAB
    CLINICAL -.->|record_id · UUID logic| PHARMACY
    PATIENT -.->|patient_id · UUID logic| PHARMACY
    ORGANIZATION -.->|doctor/department/staff UUID| PHARMACY
    PATIENT -.->|patient_id · UUID logic| BILLING
    CLINICAL -.->|record_id · UUID logic| BILLING
    ORGANIZATION -.->|department_id · UUID logic| BILLING
    PHARMACY -.->|prescription_id, dispense_id · UUID| BILLING
    PATIENT -.->|patient_id · UUID logic| NOTIFICATION
    ORGANIZATION -.->|department_id dimension| REPORT
    PHARMACY -.->|drug_id dimension| REPORT

    ORGANIZATION -.->|publish organization events| EVENTS
    PATIENT -.->|publish patient events| EVENTS
    CLINICAL -.->|publish clinical events| EVENTS
    LAB -.->|publish lab events| EVENTS
    PHARMACY -.->|publish prescription events| EVENTS
    BILLING -.->|publish billing events| EVENTS
    NOTIFICATION -.->|publish notification.sent| EVENTS
    EVENTS -.->|result / prescription events| CLINICAL
    EVENTS -.->|medicalrecord + payment| LAB
    EVENTS -.->|payment.completed| PHARMACY
    EVENTS -.->|clinical + lab + prescription| BILLING
    EVENTS -.->|6 notification triggers| NOTIFICATION
    EVENTS -.->|6 report projection events| REPORT

    LEGEND[Chú giải<br/>Trong mỗi DB: quan hệ vật lý xem ERD 2.3.1–2.3.8<br/>Nét đứt xanh: UUID/REST logic · không phải FK<br/>Nét đứt cam: integration event qua RabbitMQ]

